            {"id": 2, "text": "Their assigned company name followed by the flight level or the first three characters of the aircraft registration.", "correct": false},
            {"id": 3, "text": "Their assigned company name followed by the flight number or the last three characters of the aircraft registration.", "correct": true},
            {"id": 4, "text": "Their assigned company name followed by the flight number or the first three characters of the aircraft registration.", "correct": false}
          ]
        },
        {
          "question_id": "3.23",
          "question_text": "According to transmission of numbers, the UTC hour \"0920\" is pronounced as:",
