            {"id": 2, "text": "When initial contact is being established, and again when the communication is concluded.", "correct": false},
            {"id": 3, "text": "When the communication is concluded.", "correct": true},
            {"id": 4, "text": "Only when ATC asks for it.", "correct": false}
          ]
        },
        {
          "question_id": "4.21",
          "question_text": "What should you do first when you realize your aircraft is in distress?",
          "options": [
            {"id": 1, "text": "Contact air traffic control and declare an emergency", "correct": true},
            {"id": 2, "text": "Check the weather conditions", "correct": false},
            {"id": 3, "text": "Inform passengers about the situation", "correct": false},
            {"id": 4, "text": "Attempt to fix the issue yourself", "correct": false}
          ]
        },
        {
          "question_id": "4.22",
          "question_text": "What is the correct phraseology to request taxi clearance from ground control?",
