            {"id": 2, "text": "SAR.", "correct": false},
            {"id": 3, "text": "Quebec Radio.", "correct": false},
            {"id": 4, "text": "The station responsible for its transmission.", "correct": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "question_id": "4.24",
          "question_text": "The first transmission of the distress call and message by an aircraft should be made on:",
